Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:15.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1897)\an4\fs40\fn@方正准圆_GBK\frz-90\pos(820.667,286)}{\alphaFF\t(0,560,1,\alpha0}守{\alphaFF\t(40,560,1,\alpha0}护{\alphaFF\t(120,560,1,\alpha0}好{\alphaFF\t(210,560,1,\alpha0}我{\alphaFF\t(290,560,1,\alpha0}的{\alphaFF\t(370,560,1,\alpha0}家{\alphaFF\t(460,600,1,\alpha0}人\N\N\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\alphaFF\t(620,689,1,\alpha0}就{\alphaFF\t(710,773,1,\alpha0}是{\alphaFF\t(800,856,1,\alpha0}现{\alphaFF\t(870,920,1,\alpha0}在\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\alphaFF\t(960,1000,1,\alpha0}我{\alphaFF\t(1040,1040,1,\alpha0}所{\alphaFF\t(1090,1090,1,\alpha0}能{\alphaFF\t(1120,1120,1,\alpha0}做{\alphaFF\t(1160,1160,1,\alpha0}的{\alphaFF\t(1200,1250,1,\alpha0}一{\alphaFF\t(1290,1330,1,\alpha0}切
